---
description: Prevent agents from bypassing build/permission errors by editing config
globs: next.config.js,next.config.ts,package.json,Dockerfile,.devcontainer/**
---

# Build & permissions policy

- Never modify `distDir`, `outDir`, or any build output path to work
  around a permissions or EACCES error.
- Never add `sudo` to npm/yarn/pnpm scripts or suggest running builds with sudo.
- If a build or install step fails due to permissions, stop and report
  the exact error and the path involved. Do not apply a workaround.
- Permission errors are fixed with `chown -R $(whoami) .next node_modules`,
  not by relocating the output directory.
